  "details": "I’m very unnerved by eye contact irl and on avatars that don’t have eye tracking the eyes will default to constantly staring at you all the time. It makes it hard for me to play the game because it makes me so nervous and my anxiety shoots through the roof. I wish there was a way to disable that and make other’s avatars stare straight ahead, or maybe have their eyes track their hand movements, rather than you. \n\nSorry if this post is worded strange I have never posted before! :D",
